title: OpenAI Platform: Project costs
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows provider-reported cost for one project. No thresholds are hard-coded; optional today and month-to-date upper thresholds can be configured. Usage/cost documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10478918-reviewing-api-usage-and-costs.
item: OpenAI project name.
discovery: Project cost service discovery can be enabled or disabled with the OpenAI Platform project service discovery rule.  One service is discovered for each project returned by OpenAI.
